  505: # typedef of the class, one in a file outside src/game (SD3, the tests, the tools), and a member of
  506: # a class a manager header only forward-declares or defines inside a macro. A column-0 line that
  507: # CALLS `Class::member(` without ending in ';' (a one-line function body) reads as a definition;
